window.RVE=window.RVE||{};window.RVE["com.knudge.me"]=[[5,"It it the Best App I have found so far to improve your English. The app is simple, on point, engaging, enjoyable. It offers much to improve your English vocabulary, grammar, learning with games, various courses and much more. The Pro version is totally worth it, you will never regret. It is one of the best Investments you could make. The Developer is also very prompt and helpful. Just go with it..👍🏻","2021-01",388,"+effect,+short,+fun,+wish"],[5,"I have tried many apps but I guess this one's the best for learning english. It has all the courses..you can choose whatever you want..the kind of technique that it uses to make us remember the words for a longer time is just awesome...I think the hardwork behind developing this app is highly appreciable. Thank you so much for making this..I am definitely gonna be ur permanent user😁... Well done👏","2020-11",361,"+effect"],[4,"It gave you nice way to learn new words. It's strengthen your vocabulary. U also set a goal to complete everyday. Overall I like this app, nd highly recommend you to download this, trust me it's an awesome app.🙂 But after completion of some course it asks for upgrade, in which you have to pay yearly payment or you can also pay in one-time for lifetime.","2020-09",212,""],[3,"First I didn't thought this will work. But this app showed that my thought is wrong. I like there unique way of creating the pictures , which denoting the words. And also it won't insist us to study the words in daily basis, when ever we'll be free, that time we can study it. By this app, I didn't feel like I am studying but its like I am playing. But this would be free for a particular days. After that u need to pay if you want to use it.","2023-01",196,"pay,bug,+habit,+free"],[5,"Amazing approach used in app to teach u new words, even during one's busy schedule. Learning intensity and frequency of notifications is adjustable, and the bite sized cards include picture depictions of the words wch helps one remember them very easily. That's great! By far the best English language learning app i have come across.. I'm also inclined to good graphics and UI of any app and this one is just that. Use it. You won't regret it. I took the feedback from the app and suggested a few things which I think can help us even more, wch I hope will be addressed soon. Also, the examples of usage of the words should be more than it is rightnow in the app and if each word has an example in two or more tenses then it would give a better understanding of using the word in different situations. Thanks Knudge.me 😊✌","2018-09",184,"+effect,+short,+exam,+lockp,+wish"],[4,"Awesome app to increase your vocabulary !! It also lets you to decide howany words you want to learn per day, like 2 or 3 or 4 or more. But I would recommend that whenever you learn a new word, search its meaning on Google also because there are multiple meanings of some words. This way, it will help to learn new words more efficiently. Nice app 👍","2021-01",173,""],[5,"Probably one of the most complete apps that I'm using to learn Enlgish. Personally, I recommend to fork over the premium (lifetime, so long as posible, sometimes it values even less than yearly), since I guess the extra games, offline courses and tools are useful enough to worth the effort. The only think I could ask for would be more games and minis, but no longer than that.","2020-11",164,"+fun"],[5,"Best app to learn and memorize words. I've been using this app for nearly 3 years now. To be genuine, it helped me a lot and Ive learned many words and idioms from this app. It has words which are commonly used in newspapers articles, rapid fire games and words used in professional English communications. It has helped me clear most of the government exams and English comprehension. I'm very thankful of the creator. Very Excellent App!","2021-05",153,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[5,"I have been actively using this app for only a few weeks but I feel like my vocabulary has improved a lot. It is not too overwhelming and I like how it uses pictures to represent the meaning of certain words. The premium version is great btw and it is worth spending your money on. Please continue to upgrade the app and make it better for everyone.","2021-07",153,"+effect,+wish"],[2,"I used this app since one month even subscribed for monthly pack. Once the next month started Without any indication money got deducted from my account its my choice whether to continue it or not with no formal information prior money is been debited Kindly solve this issue for me am truly annoyed. Next time please give an prior notice !!","2019-11",145,"pay,data"],[2,"I do not understand the 4.7 rating. This app contains incortect and irrelevant word explanations. Explaining a very rare word with another similarly rare one does not help. And yes, sometimes it just oversimplified the meaning of something. I became disappointed after first good impressions.","2019-04",143,""],[5,"This. Is a very nice app and is useful for those who want to improve their vocabulary and grammar. This app helps in remembering vocabulary by the games and reminders of learned app. And I have a suggestion that please enable this app in pc version also (fully),. This is my kind request, please enable this app to move to SD Card. Which will be very helpful to save storage.","2021-06",131,"+effect,+fun,+lockp,+wish"],[1,"the in principle predatory practice of limiting the usage of an app to squeeze money out of users is something I've grown accustomed to in colourful games aimed at children or parents with money to waste, not educational applications.","2019-07",128,"pay"],[4,"The flashcards is probably the most helpful part of the app, as are the mini courses. Even though some courses are mediocre, they can be helpful as they teach you the rules with examples. The games could use improvements. The Journey segment is targetted to students, so if you're a professional writer I don't think it'll help you much (althought the new English course is coming). The narator voice is a computer, not a person, and it's disappointing to hear it. The app is cheap though: I got 3 months dirt cheap on sale, so it's worthwhile. Even so, I suggest you become a reader and read books and only sometimes visit these apps (free Magoosh Vocab app is also good for expanding the vocabulary, and their examples are far better written). Cheers","2021-02",123,"+effect,+review,+fun,+exam,+free,+wish"],[5,"Actually I don't have anything to complain about the app. I do really love the interface. The developer has made sure that the user learn the words that they see in the app by using various rounds like quiz, usage, antonyms and synonyms. They have also limited the number of words per day . They also follow the shuffling of the words in their alphabetical order. It is also provided with some minis . Yeah on the whole I love it.","2021-10",116,""],[5,"A must for anyone who wants to improve their English. The games are great as well and the daily assignments help keep everything fresh. I made people at work download it because I had such a great time with it! I think room for improvement on some aspects such as the games having more variety of words such as the locker game, polarity etc. I also wish we had a way of adding words to repeat in lessons, especially words which are difficult and aren't easily heard in day to day speaking.","2019-09",115,"+fun,+habit,+wish"],[4,"Its a Nice app it has helped to improve my vocabulary by alot. I just wish knudge.me can add a pronunciation feature where there's a conversation between two people like a word sample but this time in the form of an actual conversation. Except that's already in the premium package i dont know, but it'll be a nice addition, will help to improve pronunciation skill.","2020-09",112,"+effect,+listen,+wish"],[5,"I am loving this app. It has all the features that I could ever ask for. The cards that pop up everyday are very essential in my learning. The interval they take to pop up also help in making the new words stick on the mind. I love the strategy that has been taken in its development. Use of images for different words create visualizations making it easier to remember not only the words but also their meanings. This app is great for learning and you should not think twice about installing it.","2021-08",111,"+effect"],[2,"Dissapointed. Unsure what age group it's targeted at, but continually interrupts regarding words one should have already known for years. In the time I've had it installed I've seen just one word I was unfamiliar with, and it didn't come up enough times for me to recall it nor it's meaning. Think I'll opt for peace & quiet, and uninstall.","2019-02",97,"wish"],[5,"Wonderful app.. Some features good to have - currently new word is shown in the flashcards, with example sentence. It would be good if you show the same or similar example sentence with a blank and give option with the original word along with some antonym or other words... User can then recall and click on the correct option. This will help the user to learn the new word in a better way.","2019-04",94,"+review,+exam"],[2,"Good if you want to spend some money. The lessons/challenges are well thought and made to be enjoyable. The free features are all good. It's just that for me, the constant prompt asking me to buy knudge pro is just a destroyer of immersion. It really got to me today, and I have uninstalled the app. If you dont mind seeing this pop up everytime, or if you have the extra money to buy knudge pro, this is the app for you.","2021-12",93,"pay"],[4,"Every topic and grammatical section is very systematically and generously presented in the application. This app is so interesting and helpful for the beginners as well as for veterans. Entirely Recommended..... But please unlock some features without selling pro subscription. There's is only a tiny problem with credits unlocking system. I hope you will give some concession on it.","2021-07",88,"+effect,+wish"],[5,"This is an excellent app to strengthen your vocabulary and grammar. It doesn't only focus on teaching you new words but also focuses on teaching us the necessary rules of English. For example: when to capitalis. This app also provides us with fun little games that can increase our focus, digest to learn facts about words and their substitutes. This is all provided to us for free while also being fun.","2024-02",88,"+fun,+exam,+free"],[3,"I wish it were an option to report grammatical errors or incorrect definitions. \"Opt\" does not mean \"Best\" it is short for \"Option\" and means to make a decision. like: \"She opted to be a part of the meeting today\" I've played for a few minutes and have found a couple errors already. I would hate for someone who's new to English learn something incorrect because the app was not being diligent enough.","2021-10",87,"bug,wrong,wish,+short,+wish"],[4,"The app is great! But it needs some contents to be refined and more content is required. This is because the cover letter writing exercises do not have description of the person who is writing the cover letter and that causes mismatch between our answers and apps, plus the games are very fun and engaging but would be great if we get more and more diffrent type of questions, I have seen some questions repeating itself throughout the game. So Knudge.me please look after this and optimize the app.","2023-01",87,"+fun,+wish"],[4,"The best app ever! The only thing is that I hope you can use easier words for the explanation, after all, we came here to learn the words, and it would be kinda inconvenient if we have to search the meaning of the word that actually was supposed to provide the meaning. If can't change to easier words, I was hoping that maybe you can have a feature like allowing us to know the meaning of the word(which was supposed to explain the meaning of another word)so that we wouldn't need to search for it.","2021-03",86,"+short,+wish"],[5,"Great app. Really pushes use and practice with each word in the vocab course. One problem I've had is with the Word Maze game. It seems to be unresponsive. I swipe the letters and nothing happens or the wrong letters are highlighted. I had someone else play it to make sure it wasnt just me and it preformed the same. All the other games are great though.","2018-12",80,"+fun"],[5,"The best vocabulary builder out there! I've tried several similar apps and this one is the visually appealing; easy to use & understand; and the most comprehensive. I love the fact that there are so many different levels and learning modalities. Keeps me occupied for a good long time. 5 stars! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","2020-08",80,"+short"],[1,"whoever designed this app clearly has no knowledge of English. you can't just open a dictionary and write down the most difficult words you can find make make an app of of them. suggested words were impractical and straight up obsolete. plus the whole thing is a scam just to get you pay them.","2019-06",79,"pay,ui"],[4,"This is a very useful app. It helps develop and grow my vocabulary, and it stimulates my brain. As I learn new words, I remember them and use them daily in my life. However, I gave it 4 stars because I feel like they could motivate the person more, so they feel as if they need to practice that day. Other than that, this app is great","2021-01",79,"+effect,+fun,+habit"],[4,"The app works ok for the most part. It's always frustrating when you have to pay to get the full app. The overall look and feel is pretty good, ergonomic and modern. The echo game needs a lot of fixing. First, the voice is pretty unclear sometimes, it'll say something like \"hupstart\" which isn't even a word and then when I type in what it means it'll say that it said absurd. That's pretty absurd if you ask me. If you don't pay for pro then you don't get half the things, it's ok if you need vocab","2019-10",73,"+fun"],[4,"Update:- Please ignore the below mentioned comment. I was able to retrieve my ID Old Comment:- Why I would buy a premium amount. I've changed my device and when I'm logged in by another device. I'm not able to retrieve my subscription with the same ID. Developer should honor his commitment. I've a purchase history in Google that I've a life time subscription Resolve this issue please","2020-07",73,""],[5,"Vocabulary builder course is locked even after buying a pro version. I brought a pro version yesterday but still I did not get the course cards. Even after 24 hours cards are locked. Not able to learn the words. Need my return back. Update:- My issue has been resolved. So changing the rating. Full marks for the creativity, entertaining games which are helpful to build the vocabulary to greater extent.","2021-05",65,"+effect,+fun"],[5,"This is what an app should be. Simple, nointimidating, fun and informative. I get occasional notifications throughout the day where it tells me what a word is or if I remember what a word was that it had previously defined. The words get gradually more interesting and my knowledge base increases. So now when I get a notification sound, I hope it's a text from family or friends, my sports scores or a new word from nudge. Nice work!","2019-12",64,"+effect,+short,+fun,+lockp,+wish"],[5,"This is the best app I'd ever found. It really helps me to get more fluent in English. It is makes me as a learner not be overwhelmed with the informations I could get here, they are wise for having that kind of learning style. 「Edit: The only problem is I can't unlock the next chapter(rule) unless I purchase the app(I'm broke lol) or I have enough credit points, I hope there's other way bcs I love this app so much, especially the mini classess.」","2020-05",64,"+effect,+exam,+wish"],[2,"Games like these are what I'm looking for, but unfortunately I'm dyslexic and it takes me longer to read and comprehend some of the words. Having a timer one these games just pushes my score way further down and I just get completely turned off of the learning experience I'm actually looking for","2019-04",63,""],[5,"Really fun, effective, easy to use with incredible amount of options to choose from goals, achievements, calendar, reminder, etc. Games are easy with increasing difficulty as you progress and as you attempt to pass the level your imprinting the word with definition or synonym I'm really enjoying the experience and enriching my vocabulary. Excellent app.congratulations to the people that designed it.","2021-03",63,"+effect,+short,+fun,+lockp"],[4,"A lot of free games to choose from to build your vocabulary, grammar skills, and math skills. I particularly like their Word checker game, but it's an extra challenge for my ADD. Several words are too long for the squares, so the word has to be broken up into multiple lines. It makes it harder to see quickly, which cubes are words and which are definitions. I'd also love whenever definitions are listed in the app, it included the part of speech. Hearing the word pronounced is a nice bonus.","2024-09",57,"+short,+fun,+free"],[5,"I had tried many Apps, but this app is flawless. Everyone can use this app to ameliorate their vocabulary and can also learn English at a great height. Also, the courses which are given are genuinely captivating. But....I have one complication that there are many disruptive advertisements!","2020-12",57,""],[5,"Excellent app ! I am fortunate to have such a tremendous app for improving my vocabulary. It bring hope and confidence to my life to be a good english speaker. It is like a mentor who always stands behind me to motivate and to reach my targets every time. I haven't seen such a good app before in my life. I recommend that every one should try it.👍👌","2020-05",57,"+effect,+fun"],[3,"Very fun and effective way to improve my English. I have ADHD and this app is a perfect way for me to learn. My problem with the app is that I'm a slow reader and the time limit is way too short (especially with the Words Checker). Also the level in Fly High goes up too quickly, I'm no longer able to finish the Daily Workout because it's gotten too hard. In my opinion I should only gain points in Fly High if I win the game so the progress would be more effective.","2019-05",56,"bug,wish,+effect,+short,+fun,+habit,+wish"],[5,"The app is awesome. My only request to developers is that maybe you could simply add a feature that would let me know more about a given word, eg a button to Google search the word within the app, so that i could stay within the app and not get distracted.","2019-03",55,""],[5,"Truly awesome experience with Knudge! I was indeed in need of such an app. Daily flashscards are really helpful. I would suggest the team to build a dictionary but i appreciate their efforts.. Really reliable and efficient for developing your vocabulary and grammar... I personally recommend this to expand your world knowledge. One of the best apps!!","2019-11",53,"+effect,+habit"],[4,"1. It causes navigation buttons to be off many times so I have to press anywhere everytime that notification shows up 2. Some games like Words Checker and Echo just build up too fast to reach Intermediate/Advanced vocabs and it kinda troubles me as a non-native speaker. If this app also targets the non-native speakers, I think it's best to slow down the pace and include the easy ones more often because it's helpful for people who haven't learnt English for a long time to brush up again.","2020-05",52,"+effect,+short,+fun,+lockp"],[1,"Only good function was a daily words quiz though they were relatively rarely used words. But even this suddenly stopped after few weeks. Now all the notification i see are discounts and sale offs. Very disappointing app","2019-03",51,"lock"],[5,"This app is helping me, as a senior, to realize how much I have forgotten since my school days. It's actually entertaining, with a twist of fun playing the included games, to refresh my memory and to re-learn what I may have forgotten or I did not learn. Helps to keep my \"retired\" mind exercised. Just like the body needs activity to maintain functionality, so does the brain; this app is doing what I need and want.","2019-01",51,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[5,"Fantastic app. Great for multiple uses and for long term and short term use. Great value. Perfect in every way. Love how customizable it is and the friendly notifications. Very applicable to daily living and daily life. I love that I can strengthen my vocabulary/language in my spare time and strengthen multiple areas of my brain at the same time.","2019-02",48,"+short,+habit,+custom,+lockp"],[5,"It's a very good app to exapnd your vocabulary. When you forget your session, It reminds to go practice. Content can be repeated if not well understood. You given a word and it's similarity plus antonyms. Moreover, how the words can be used in a sentence. Also, short quiz after finishing the session to make sure you understood the meaning well. It's awesome!!🙂","2020-01",47,"+short,+review"],[4,"A good app to build your vocabulary. You could go for it. I tried its free course, and i got to learn so much. But the other side of this app is that, after using it a month or two you will get bored because at that time you will notice that it gives you a lot of not so important words. You will be most probably use those words in your day to day conversation. And thats all.","2020-03",46,"+free"],[4,"Great app to learn new words. I just want few more features I think is essential for me. Firts, when I get a wrong answer or studing a second or third card (synonymous, examples), sometimes I just want to look into the definition card again. If I can look it up with a click it would me enormously helpful. Second, in the library menu for reviewing the cards, if there was an additional filter to only see the words in progress excluding the unread words would be nice, because I want to review the words I already learned before getting a new one.","2018-10",45,"+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[1,"If you're looking to actually learn new words and improve your vocabulary, look elsewhere. This is just random dumb games that wont let you actually learn anything since it's too focused on \"games and challenges\". I'm in the middle of finally finding a \"course/game\" that might help me before i realized im apparently not answering fast enough because i kept losing lives and the questions would change. So at which point in this lame game format am i supposed to learn a damn thing!?","2019-03",44,"bug,wish"],[1,"Great app with one issue See, when I write a note about a specific word the window that appears is simply unusable, as it shows a mid tone grey on a light tone grey background and it's hard to make any edit to it. I thought this might be the case with the dark mode so I manually turn off the dark mode for knudge.me but still the problem remains unchanged. I love the app that's why I bought premium for both Knude.me and the exam vocab. I am looking forward to see this app grow ♥️","2022-04",43,"pay"],[3,"Best app for learning English language. Please add a feature to open multiple course or mini course at same time, so that we can learn simultaneously. And also add the dictionary feature also.. at least in pro. It should include pronunciation, part of speech, synonyms, antonyms etc of each word. Pro users should have some extra perks otherwise what's the meaning of paying for premium.","2020-02",43,"pay,voice,wish,+listen,+wish"],[5,"Currently, I'm using the common confusing words feature.. English is my only language and it has helped me quite a bit. Good job! Previously gave four stars only because I'm using one part of the app. Though I'm gaining a lot from it so my rating went to five stars.","2018-10",42,"+effect"],[5,"Great Application! I bought the pro version, one time buy, because it is worth it. I love the fact that through notifications keeps me in training. The vocabulary is getting from easy to difficult on your pace. And the greatest of all is that the simple games use the word connections and meanings in a way to make you remember. It is one of the best apps out there! Definitely worth buying.","2018-12",41,"+effect,+short,+fun,+lockp"],[5,"I love it !!! I purchased the lifetime membership with a reasonable discount price ...And I definitely won't regret it...It has tons and tons of vocabulary with creative, pictorial and fun way...Not only vocabulary but also phrases, proverbs, Grammar parts and the lists goes on...I really appreciate all the team members for their untiring work...I will strongly recommend it anyone who decides to improve their language skills..Keep going !! 😀😀😄😄","2020-02",40,"+fun,+wish"],[1,"Enjoyed the app for the most part expect for the quiz and questions that change your answer from the one you click on then swipe to the next page so you can't see that it's wrong until the summary shows you what you missed and it's not the answer you submitted (I've done it multiple times now). Pretty annoying to get a 70% and only 5/20 coins back despite answering every question right. This is definitely keeping me from buying the full version. Why would I want to pay for this?","2020-02",39,"pay,ui"],[1,"This app is on its way to becoming a money grab. First they asked to become a pro member now they are asking again to pay for their new feature \"Journey\". I shouldn't have bought pro membership. There are better alternative available at the play store for less money.","2019-02",37,"pay"],[4,"Good app. I like the daily quizzes to help you memorize vocabulary words. The app visits each word multiple times, ensuring you're building an understanding of them. However, the games are too easy if you're fluent in English. They're boring to the point they're unplayable; there should be an option to change the difficulty.","2021-04",37,"+effect,+short,+fun,+habit"],[5,"BEST APP EVER exceeded all my expectations, I loved everything about it. I am currently using the free version because i am a student and usually in other apps they hardly provide any features unless you pay extra but this app has done justice. You get SO many feature even if you are not capable of paying money. Highly impressed and definitely telling my friends about it!","2023-08",37,"+free"],[1,"Very useless app. There is a weird system of credits. You can only unlock words if you have credits, for which you have to make purchases. Basically it wofks horribly if you dont pay them any money. If you want a free app to learn new words or improve english, then dont go for this","2023-06",36,"pay,wish"],[5,"I love this app. I don't give 5 stars unless I really feel it is worth it. All the games are smooth and well crafted. The different courses help in learning different aspects of English grammar and general usage. There is of course scope for improvement in terms of how much practice the courses give but overall Content is really good","2019-09",36,"+fun,+wish"],[5,"Wow! What an amazing, productive, positive, and resourceful app. I'm a college student who majors in social sciences and writes A LOT of technical papers. This app has significantly improved my English and has helped me in many ways including improved writing and translating new words; it also boosted my speaking and communication abilities. The app is easy to use, i love the daily words, love the quizzes and extra games, and i love the bright colored UI. Thank you developers!!!","2018-12",33,"+effect,+short,+fun,+habit,+wish"],[4,"Love the app interface but there are two basic thing that I think would make it much better. 1. The explanation on the word should be done in basic English. What's the point of explaining thing with word that the learner need to open another dictionary to understand it. We are lazy people, please don't demotivate us . 😁 2. The notification whether we still remember the word. I don't even learn the word yet, but the app already ask me the meaning of the word.","2019-06",32,"+effect,+fun,+lockp"],[4,"This app is quite interesting👏 it has different courses which are really good. It ensures learning new words to build our vocabulary by sending notifications now and then. One of the best apps to learn English in a better way.","2022-01",32,"+lockp"],[3,"The APP is not bad, but the games - or better the game time limits - suck. Especially if you want to learn English. Disable the time limits or insert an option to disable, enable or pause the time limit. Then you have a new customer.","2021-09",31,"+fun,+custom"],[2,"This app has some helpful things to learn from but if you want to improve vocabulary, look elsewhere as words they want you to learn are some gibberish never seen before, the words you'll never use in spoken English.","2021-08",30,"wish"],[4,"I have been using this app since a week now. If you use this app on a daily basis, it will benefit you definitely. Learning about new words and then getting reminder notifications regarding it helps to cement the word in mind. The other sections like digest is very helpful too. Update: The UK sound in the echo game is pretty bad. Sometimes, the word is totally different from what it's spoken.","2020-05",28,"+effect,+fun,+habit,+lockp"],[5,"This is a great app with great features and the tool you need to better your overall vocabulary and Grammer. However I must insist that you classify words in exercises and tests, it makes it easier to know what it means and how to use it also out would be nice if you are a dictionary, spelling bee, and notification reminder from time to time even if it will draw over other apps. Great app. Thanks","2024-05",28,"+exam,+lockp,+wish"],[5,"This app is really great if you suffer with the English language or for aspiring writers with a brief vocabulary. It's a great app. Recommend it to all. Helps with Comprehension skills and provides new words every day. There are a few quizzes and even games. Love the app. Give it 5 stars.","2019-12",28,"+effect,+fun,+habit"],[3,"Is there a way to hear the pronunciation of the words / word pairs in the Game Report? I found no way. This is a major shortcoming. Without knowing the proper pronunciation, it is not possible to learn any foreign language effectively. The games are almost hit and miss regarding the words, no place to learn their meanings before \"testing\". Of course, I could grab a dictionary, but at this point the app worth nothing. Doesn't give enough repetition to learn. Can't reach them via the contact email","2023-10",27,"voice,cs,+effect,+short,+review,+fun,+listen,+exam"],[5,"I love the overall experience I have gotten this far from this app. Its explanation and definition of concepts are concise and easy to understand. Activities and games after each section are well planned and helping to reinforce concepts learnt. In few weeks, my vocab has increased by 5%","2021-03",27,"+short,+fun"],[5,"I think, this is an excellent app for learning vocabularies as well as grammers. There are many apps which provide pictures for vocabulary. But, Knudge.me provides animated pictures which is much more fun. It also offers minis for improving grammer. I would like to thank the developers who created this brilliant app.","2020-07",26,"+effect,+fun"],[4,"So far I'm liking it. Downloaded it to brush up and expand my vocabulary and it's a lovely way to do so! Main advice to Knudge creators, please get someone more crisp in their enunciation. The Echo game and the introduction cards sometimes sound nothing like the actual word. \"T\"s and\" D\"s are often hard to decipher and other times a word is so badly enunciated (mainly in the Echo game) that neither myself nor my husband can gather what word is actually being said.","2019-01",25,"+fun"],[5,"Creative, informative and probably the best use of notifications that I've seen. Can't imagine the amount of time and energy spent on designing the template for the daily words. A must try if you are looking to enhance your vocabulary.","2019-10",25,"+habit,+lockp"],[4,"It's a great app, you can learn a bunch of vocabulary word. But to make it five star rating, I suggest the developer add synonyms on every word they gave, to understand it more easily.","2020-05",22,""],[5,"The app content was not adequate last year and I digested all the things I could learn on it and deleted it eventually. Recently I wanted to check it out if something new was added or not at all and amazed at first glance! The courses and games seemed to be really improved and got richer. The only thing I disliked is its price for the pro version. I literally just can't afford it more than a few months :/ It would worth the $ if the app had some etymology examples, pronunciations etc. 🤷🏼‍♂️","2020-07",22,"+effect,+fun,+listen,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Best and a unique app to learn and enhance your vocabulary in an effective way. I liked the way they send quizzes in form of notifications. Also we can set how many of such we receive in a day. There are other benefits as well too many fun games and challenges. Highly recommended!!","2024-01",22,"+effect,+fun,+lockp"],[5,"Before sharing my review, I'd like to thank one of my favourite English's YouTube channel ' let's talk'. I got the link from one of their videos. So, i decided to install this app after downloading this one i was really over the moon when i opened and started using this; it has been satisfying me a lot since day one. I must say this one is the best app, I've got because i had been searching for such kind of app for a long to improve my English skills. Thank you so much for making this app😊.","2020-01",22,"+review,+wish"],[1,"The only thing of this application show how you do not know English instead of encourage to learn it. Especially the games, mainly word checker, i never pass it once.. There is a lot of application such as Oxford, BBC etc for free and motivate you to learn English.","2019-01",21,""],[5,"In particular, if you're just starting to learn English, this app is truly fantastic. Many English rules and their usage are provided to you. This app is also helpful in improving and broadening our knowledge of English grammar, vocabulary, writing, and listening. Regardless of proficiency level, this app is excellent for English language learners. To individuals who wish to improve their English, I personally would strongly suggest this program.","2024-07",21,"+effect,+listen,+wish"],[1,"Please change the normal font to white from grey. By default the title is white and the small text is grey. Now grey is difficult to read in the dark mode. Try to read it in low brightness. I'll change the ratings to 5 if you fix this. Also it doesn't make much sense to me to keep the home-screen white as usual and only keep the dark mode in the cards.","2022-04",20,""],[4,"I literally fell in love with the app on the first sight💖❤❤but as everything needs more improvement;I would highly recommend that if you can show the user the record of what their learning through a graph or table,it would be amazing,otherwise great app👍👍👍","2024-02",20,"+wish"],[5,"Brilliant app! I am quite a good English speaker but found this app useful in many ways at first use! New words, exercises, gamified learning, gradually increasing difficulty levels and a ton more! Must have taken loads of hard work and finessing, bought a lifetime membership and intend to use everyday, thanks guys!","2020-09",20,""],[4,"Good, but would rather see adds and get more functionality than pay. but I may upgrade. Really seems to help me learn. One issue is the app will periodically give you a notification that checks of you recall a word. It pops up over any app or screen and you have several options to choose from. If you miss-tap, you may choose the wrong synonym/definition. I wish there was a way to confirm your choise before it submits","2019-06",19,"+lockp,+wish"],[2,"I seriously agree with most comments. It's frustrating to work against time as we want to increase our knowledge, yes maybe later compete. This time factor is demotivating. English is not everyone's first language and one want to feel eager to play. The App is not considerate of my time as I spend most of my time replaying. I have a suggestion: why not consider different levels of difficulty. I believe more people will be interested in buying.","2019-06",18,""],[2,"Only had it about 2 hours before deleting it. There's no setting to change the frequency of notifications and I got 4 notifications in 2. Damn. Hours. I was looking for like 1 per day. Not to mention it's trying to shove the paid upgrade down your throat every second you're in the app","2021-01",18,"lock"],[3,"I like the bite-sized courses, engaging games, and spaced repetition system have been invaluable in expanding my word bank and strengthening my understanding of the language. However, I believe the app's potential could be further unlocked by adding support for Spanish language learning. As someone interested in expanding my linguistic horizons, I would be thrilled to see the same engaging approach applied to building Spanish vocabulary.","2024-02",18,"+short,+review,+fun"],[5,"Awesome app for improving English, I am in the vocabulary builder intermediate course right now. The app makes use of mnemonic techniques like visualisation to make us understand and remember words and their meanings and be able to use them too. It also tests the knowledge so gained by way of MCQs and in addition, it also has some pretty awesome games for testing and improving your grammar and vocabulary. A one of a kind app with a very unique idea, totally worth it.","2020-06",18,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[5,"I play quick rounds of the game when I feel unfocused or when I have difficulty with word retrieval. I've notice that I can retrieve the correct vocabulary words to express my thoughts more accurately quicker than in the past. I'm happy with the experience.","2022-05",18,"+short,+fun"],[4,"It's an amazing app to improve grammar with phrasal verbs. And among those grammar curriculum activities that have mistaken by ourselves . If we get it's proper explaination with help of grammar, we will get ahead into that..","2021-10",17,"+wish"],[5,"This app should be in everyone's bag.. Download it... So the above one is my previous review which dates back to 2018. (which also happens to be my first abd only review on any app). It has been more than 2 years and I havent uninstalled this app and I also see new courses added to it which could be accessed through credits (that you can ear through learning). I change nothing, this app is amazing and I'm always having it in my phone.","2021-02",17,"+review"],[5,"It helps you build your vocabulary by giving words daily and later checking whether you understood them. It's a nice way of reviewing the work covered and also the examples given in sentences. Good job! However, kindly improve your pronunciation. It takes very long to vocalize after sever taps and sometimes it does not at all.","2023-11",16,"+effect,+review,+listen,+exam,+habit,+wish"],[5,"It is really a nice app for improving Vocabulary as well as learning different concepts of Grammer with the help of games and bit size of Cards.Furthermore, in minis section there are different types of courses that learners can enroll and learn ....I have been using this for long time and now I love it...........🤗🤗🤗","2020-07",16,"+effect,+fun"],[1,"I liked this app so I purchased it's pro version for life time. Now after a while, they have canceled my purchase and asking to pay again. This is unfair.","2023-07",15,"pay"],[2,"many spelling & Grammatical mistakes arer there. Leading in the wrong direction.Please check and correct it. like spelling of travelling,pair of trousers takes singular verb form.And the Charges are too high . Besides there should be given some free excess to those who spands more time in your app .","2022-03",14,"wrong"],[3,"I dislike the UI. To me, the course should be the highest in the IA, not games. Games should be secondary. When I revisited the app, I had to think where the flashcards I remembered was located. They were under My course. Now inside it, I wish \"Finish your unread cards\" was a button.","2021-03",14,"ui,wish,+effect,+review,+fun,+wish"],[3,"Where is grammer. Edit: so I get to know that homepage is different from what I thought. I have to select a course to get to homepage. But still I don't find any complete grammar improvement section in minis or journey or anywhere else. Maybe you have included some part of it but want a complete grammer based learning. I'm giving three for these efforts. And change the initial page it gives very bad first impression.","2021-04",13,"wish,+wish"],[5,"An amazing app that has helped me improve my Englsih vocabulary by an enormous amount. Results have also been visible in my school essays and projects, which have had a significant increase on the gradescale. I cannot address enough how the service and learning techniques that come with this app have improved my ability to converse with people and formulate english texts. I greatly recommend this app!","2019-01",13,"+effect,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Been using this a week and I'm already seeing the benefits. The my course vocabulary builder is excellent. Through the aggrandisation of my vocabulary I am already receiving deference as a results of the aberration of everyday discourse. Once you get passed the clutered interface its great. The games are a little easy so far; when you level up however, they're supposed to get hard, I'm looking forward to it.","2022-08",13,"+short,+fun"],[1,"Why I am unable to move forward on the 'journey' section? The app is asking me to become a pro member, and if I don't I will not be able to move forward. This is what I dislike about the app. I can't continue unless I become a member. I am going to uninstall this app. Do I have to pay to become a 'pro member?'","2020-04",12,"pay"],[2,"When doing the cards if you dont know the answer you have a 50% chance of getting some of the them right which can falsify if you actually know the word. all together I feel this app hasn't helped me learn. I even bought it..... The synonyms hardly ever make sense. Maybe its just my poor vocabulary? I dont know, but this doesn't seem to help lol.","2019-07",12,""],[2,"Vocabulary Builder course user. Was quite satisfied at first and upgraded to PRO after a monthbof trial. Yet very annoyed with following experience - Currently at advanced level, there is NO learning component, almost all of the daily new cards are tests right away, asking if you RECALL a word that was never shown/explained before. A drastically different user experience from trial period. Recommend not to upgrade, use the free version for as much as you cannget out of it","2019-03",12,""],[4,"This is the only English learning app, I have seen most star ratings by users. Without hesitating I have gone for pro version. Definitely spending a money to improve your skills always gives you the best. Let's hope this app gives lot of learnings to me","2021-01",12,"+wish"],[1,"I used to love this app years ago. I downloaded it today and was very disappointed. The swiping through cards was a lot of fun as yoh could swipe up or down for words that you don't know or want to learn. They removed it.. they removed all the fun parts, and we're left with a mediocre looking interface that looks like it was designed in 2012. I do not understand why you had to make it so boring. You used to be so much better than wordUp with all the stats, the swiping and numbers of words.","2024-03",11,"repeat,ui"],[1,"Ads are disruptive. Sound is required for some of the games and it's unacceptable to have ads blasted at full volume while using the app. A lot of the features also require membership and you're constantly reminded of that everywhere you go in the app. Terrible user experience.","2019-03",11,"ad"],[3,"I don't get it. In the beginner course this never happened. So basically, from the intermediate course to now in advanced course, words card would come as - 'Can you recall this word?' - when I have not even seen this word's definition card before. Now this is irritating as then I would answer wrong (obviously) and my accuracy level would stoop down. This is either a bug or intentional, but is sure irritating as hell. Let know the words meaning first and then ask questions. Simple.","2019-01",11,"bug,+short"],[5,"One of the best apps to challenge your vocabulary skills! The cards in the notification bar are the best feature. It basically splits and spreads out the learning into notification cards spread out across the day. Planning to purchase pro version in the next few days!","2018-10",11,"+lockp"],[5,"Brilliant! The way the app works is subtle, taking only a couple of minutes out of my day and soon, without me even knowing it, my vocabulary increased drastically. The interface was very neat as well. Kudos to the developer!","2018-12",11,"+short"],[1,"It can be good especially with the notifications that remind you to practice, but for an all meant to improve English, it doesn't understand syntax. It often asks in the notifications a yes or no question, but never gives yes or no as an option. For any higher of a rating, this blantant issue should be fixed.","2020-03",10,"lock,wish"],[1,"What is wrong with your app?! Since the past two days the app has been notifying same word \"Harrowing\" every hour or so and it's pretty creepy and scarry af. It's literally Harrowing me with the word coming up again and again. Please check on what's wrong ASAP.","2020-07",10,"repeat"],[2,"Very confusing. I selected intermediate english and the popups work fine but if i try to play the daily workout it asks me basic words like \"list\" \"strong\" etc while the pop ups ask words like \"abscission\" \"chivalry' etc... I have easy english course paused so i dont know what else could be the problem.","2019-05",10,"lock,ui"],[5,"awesome app, honestly. just wish it had an online feature where u could compete with others to see who was better. that would make it more fun. also wish i could spend more credits by watching ads instead of having to pay ^^ but overall, brilliant app! really helps.","2019-01",10,"+effect,+fun,+wish"],[1,"This app was working fine before but even though I have paid for the pro version, my Vocabulary Builder - Easy is stuck on 95% and it's not fetching any of the cards. Knudge.me team is not even responding to mail. Worst user experience.","2021-11",9,"bug"],[1,"Just keeps asking for money. Constantly annoys with notifications pushing you to buy. Horrible guys, don't install. Not recommended!!!","2018-12",9,"pay,lock"],[3,"I liked this app interface and it shows us the right vocabulary words in an very good manner and has interesting games also but if I want to give a suggestion i would say that you can reduce the payable content and add it to the free content becuase more than 50 percent of the content is not free","2020-10",9,"ui,+fun,+free"],[4,"I'm was initially upset by the false advertising of lifetime access with the pro membership as I had paid for it and was then asked to pay again for a new feature 'Journey'. The app team was prompt to address my concerns. The app is great and I am enjoying learning with it.","2019-03",9,"+fun"],[4,"Tested my knowledge of the English Language. Which is easy for me. Because I'm English. And however I speak is the correct way, and the way I spell words is the right way. Would be harder for anyone who is a not English to understand. Most people in England have to write different words than what actually they say in real life because of local dialects and accent. People in my own Country can't even understand each other. But they write the same way. Mad.","2019-03",9,"+short,+listen,+exam"],[5,"Although the app is very good and I found it valuable, however, when I subscribed to become a pro member, I paid the money for a yearly subscription, still no update has happened. I'm not able to access the pro benefits and it still asks to update to pro and when I try to tap the update option it shows that you are already a pro member. I request the team to resolve the issue by this week.","2026-03",9,""],[1,"Spam app, i am gettjng about 10 or more notifications a day, it's none stop at times.","2019-08",8,"lock"],[3,"everything is good... EXCEPT... 1. can u allow the revision/quiz to not auto end after time's up? when learning more words we need time to recall. it is too stressful to do it within short time. 2. can u allow fetching of cards even there are UNREAD cards? sometimes when we travel, we might want to fetch the cards first then read it later. since u only allow to unlock 20 cards a day EVEN i have subscribed ☹","2019-03",8,"pay,+short"],[3,"This app was great till i deleted it for some reason and then when i reinstalled it after a few months i couldn't remember the words i had learnt but the app won't let me reset my course without having to pay. So essentially I'm stuck and i can't use this app anymore unless i use a different account. Resetting the course is such a basic feature. Can at least that be free?!","2019-11",8,"pay,bug,data,+effect,+free"],[4,"it's a very good app..i say to my friends 'use this app' it will be very helpful.. but i had one problem with this app.. i want to learn English with root words.. this app also give useful root words.. if you want to recall these words it's very difficult to find the root words easily.. it taken more time.. so please correct it.. I'm waiting for that and eagerly waiting for giving five stars","2019-01",8,"+effect"],[5,"Every morning, right after getting out of bed, I check my phone and I open this app to play the games. I learn a lot of vocabularies from using this app so I decided to set a goal to use at least one of them in a conversation to enhance my skills in communication. Thanks to this app I have noticed a great change not just in my way of speaking but as well as in writing.","2018-12",8,"+fun"],[1,"Please you should give a bit more time for the game ...the people who have to think a little give a correct answer ..have difficulty. And this way one can not learn properly ..you are so busy trying to win the game in only 4 seconds that you dont get to see the word and make it memorised completely ..and after a short time you forget the word. Please cosider my request worthy to increase the time for the game. However , the 'journey' and the comprehension thing is very useful.","2020-03",7,""],[1,"This seems unfair, I had paid for a lifetime subscription because this app was offering so many good things and not only vocabulary. there used to be a quiz, tenses and grammar lessons, now this has very basic information.","2025-09",7,"pay"],[1,"I liked the app but recently it is behaving abnormally, the app is drawing itself over all other app and asking for log in again and again (i never logged out though). I don't know what's wrong but i had paid for this and still I'm getting trouble with my learning experience. Not at all happy with this situation.","2019-09",7,"data"],[1,"Seriously? For an app that is supposed to help better someone in English, they themselves don't seem to be very good at it. There are multiple mistakes in grammar, Meanings of certain words and spellings. It's a mess.","2020-09",7,"wrong"],[1,"The whole app design is such a mess. so much confusing, it took me half an hour to find out how to use it actually. Doesn't tell the user where and how to start and how to continue and what it can do","2020-11",7,"ui"],[2,"Should get rid of the time limit in the game. Or have a different section for it. I'm trying to learn not compete. like in the 'word checker' time runs out too fast and I'm not really able to immerse myself in the experience. instead just trying hurry up","2019-04",7,""],[2,"Journey's 'Everyday English' isn't available since a long time. Frustrating. It just says coming soon. I'm a pro member, this section should be available by now.","2020-06",7,""],[3,"There are a lot of things saying to buy the extra leasons or whatever, a little annoying. Also i wish the word games would only use the words you have learned so far. Im a native speaker, using the beingers mode on here...its still challenging. But besides that I like that app","2021-12",7,"ui,wish,+effect,+fun,+wish"],[5,"It may seem like there is little inside, but once you start with it, you can boost your vocabulary a lot in no time. You would use the words daily at ease. Also don't forget to re read, or firstly write everything you've learned, because once you pass one of the lessons you wont be able to go back to see othere without interrupting the ongoing lesson. And of course there are games if you are up to them to test yourself on daily bases.","2019-12",7,"+effect,+review,+fun,+exam,+habit"],[5,"I'm thoroughly impressed with KnudgeMe's diverse range of courses, including Vocabulary Builder, Grammar, and engaging Word Games. The app's educational value is exceptional, deserving a solid five-star rating. I appreciate the commitment to continuous improvement, and I'm confident that KnudgeMe will only get better with time. Keep up the excellent work!","2023-11",7,"+fun,+wish"],[5,"Awesome one...loved it, the games in this app are very interesting and also helps to improve our english in every field i.e. reading, vocab etc. This app also notifies 5-6 times a day us of a vocabulary word and tells its meaning and much moree...please download this if you need to improve your english its really helpful as my experience says","2019-09",7,"+effect,+fun,+wish"],[5,"I love the visual creativity put into each word to help facilitate definition recall. I like that I get to choose the pace of learning. This app is great for anyone that is looking to gradually build a stronger vocabulary.","2019-02",7,""],[1,"Annoying cash grab. You get a certain number of words every hour. Of course you can watch ads or buy points to get more. And let's not forget the subscription service that doubles the amount of credits you can use at a time. Worthless. Look elsewhere","2019-06",6,"pay,ad,ui"],[1,"This app isn't worth for me anyhow.. I downloaded it today and when i started signing it up, it was too frustrating fir me! I filled my informations and then after I was unable to fill opt there.. literally it is too worst!!","2021-06",6,"data"],[1,"Free version only contains a very limited features. You're forced to pay if you really wanna use it.","2020-12",6,"pay,lack"],[1,"To personal, what do you need my information for honestly add a guest feature or something simpler. Data collectors!!!","2020-07",6,""],[1,"On 15th Feb 2024 , I can't get access to the app, due to the internet connection problem from the app's alert. When I reinstalled it again, the problem still remains. I can't even login to the app for using any services; It keeps saying it can't connect to the internet when other apps are working normally, still the internet doesn't have any issues. I have no idea whether there's someone found the same problem as mine or not. If this issue has been solved, I will update my review later on.","2024-02",5,"data"],[1,"im looking for a way to improve my speech and vocabulary but the way this app is set on timed games it ends up stressing me out rather than letting me learn. i hope there is a way they can do the games without having a time factor that only causes stress and worry and nervousness.","2019-02",5,"voice,wish"],[1,"extremely annoying games, there is no real intermediate level for nonnative speakers. it is too easy or too hard. there is not a real appotonety to learn a new word. the app needs to \"generate\" the game each time. seriously!? for ten words the app needs 8 seconds to load? i played 2GB games that run faster than that. how this app got so much good reviews is the biggest mistery for me","2019-03",5,"ui"],[1,"Redicualous. All these great features and I cant even right down notes until I pay for premium. There are plenty of other apps that are all FREE that can improve my vocabulary","2020-12",5,"pay,wish"],[1,"I just want to learn common spoken english words but your apps do not cover this at all.....you have added very uncommon and not useful word even in easy english learning. i am very disappointed.","2020-05",5,""],[2,"I've purposely given a poor rating thanks to your latest prompts for subscribing after every notification!! STOP IT. And if I've not bought it after 3 tries, you should stop showing it to me!!! Your app is great. So don't piss off users with such repeat prompts. I was a paid user until a month or two ago but you decided to bump up the prices, now it's no longer value for money for me.","2023-02",5,"pay,lock,repeat"],[2,"In my opinion, this app is not useful for those with average knowledge in English. The tasks offered does not allow you enough time to think.","2018-11",5,""],[3,"I totally enjoyed the app.. and I would really like to go for pro version but the subscription price is unreasonable. i think u should start monetising after you have more people onboard. its costlier than amazon prime subscription for a year.","2019-02",5,"pay,+fun"],[4,"Nice app for expanding vocabulary. The grammar and reading training was very basic I must say. I would like to see levels of difficulty in those games, as there is already in the Fly Baloon one. I think there is a bug in the Reader Digest game, for I can see the text while I am answering the questions xD The texts in this game are very basic also, the contents of it are well known topics, so I could answer the questions correctly even without reading the text!","2019-04",5,"+fun"],[4,"Excellent app for learning. I'd like to suggest the developer to add the part of speech a word belongs to. Whether its a verb or noun etc. Apart from it, i think its a good tool to learn language and usage and words which can be used in daily vocabulary. Also difficult logging from desktop via gmail. Doesnt work. Waiting for a new update Cheers!","2020-01",5,"+habit"],[4,"I would love to give a 5 star. However, there's bug in the app which does not allow you to login to your purchased app(pro version) when you switch to a new. I ended up repurchasing it again. This has to be fixed.","2025-03",5,""],[4,"Please, when I fail to chose the correct definition for an word RESET the counter for that word because I found myself with something like... correct, fail, fail, correct, fail, fail, fail, correct... and then the application wrongly thought I learned that word and I am sure I still struggle to learn it if my last 3 choices for that word was fail, fail, correct. On this aspect the application is counterproductive, for a lot of words I pass the test because from time to time between a lot of wrong choices I chose the correct one. The best is to considerate the word learned if I chose 3-4 consecutive correct definition. So is just 4 star from me because of this.","2018-09",5,"+effect,+exam"],[4,"The app is quite interesting. But, the only problem I have is, it doesn't allow non subscribers to get all the facilities. It's better if it just introduces games to earn points and unlock all the features.","2019-05",5,"+fun"],[5,"Excellant app Helped a lot in increasing vocabulary. Expected more courses that can help exams. Credits may also be increased and preliminary test on vocabulary may be introduced to understand your progress. One more suggestion there are some words without picture. If you can impart some picture for that also would benefit us. Detailed meaning may also incorporated if feasible.","2020-04",5,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"This is a very helpful app to learn English. exactly what I was looking for! the additional journey option allows you to enroll in a course that helps you to prepare for the ielts test. Additionally, the support team is very friendly and responds fast. Thank you for this great app. I can highly recommend it to anyone who wants to improve his English.","2019-03",5,"+effect,+exam,+wish"],[5,"A fantastic app! Keep up the good work. The quizzes and pictorial representation of words are really helpful. One small suggestion, speaking from the perspective of a GRE aspirant, apart from vocab, other parts like reading comprehension and reading speed can be given greater emphasis.","2019-07",5,"+effect,+exam"],[1,"Love it, but there's nothing. ow a New content is added the content new coming like earlier has stopped , kindly refresh some new stuffs in the app like in the posts section ,like knudgeman ,etc otherwise I'll just keep s us to bored & I'll left it out by deleting the app,so there's a times for the developer to add the renewal of contents & adidtion of some things new to it ,thanks !!","2019-01",4,""],[1,"Its good. The best thing about this app is that we can learn and unlock many things by using points you get on correct answering questions . Edit- They have stopped giving points, because of which I can't use the app properly.","2020-05",4,""],[1,"Didn't look at the content before purchasing the premium plan. Looks like I made a mistake. The content in the app suffers from a lot of grammatical errors.","2023-12",4,"pay,bug,wrong"],[1,"I personally don't like this app bcoz games are very hard to play for the beginners.","2018-12",4,""],[3,"I've used in this app in the past, it's a great app, has a huge database of words. However, i'm not able to install it, the installation is stuck at 89%. I've got decent space on my phone, able to install other apps as well. However, not able to complete installation this time. Please suggest if there's some problem with the app or it seems like an issue with the installer or phone itself.","2020-05",4,"bug"],[3,"honestly really love this app but the quiz is very annoying. Its way too easy and repeats questions on the same words way too many times. i have to atleast take 9- 10 quizzes for different words to come up. You guys should let the users select the mode of the quizzes whether its easy, medium or hard. once thats fixed, i will give it 5 stars!","2019-03",4,"repeat,ui,+short"],[4,"It's a nice app with amazing features that are quite educative with regards to what concerns English language. The app's features can only be accessed online which is kinda data consuming, but it's worth it!. Also once a lesson has been opened or downloaded it can be accessible offline.","2023-10",4,""],[4,"The way it helped me on daily basis to learn new vocabulary is tremendous. Im glad I have a medium of learning on day to day basis and maintain the consistency. As the name suggest itself it sends knudge all the way . Thank you.","2019-12",4,"+effect,+habit"],[4,"Seriously, I thought it was scam based on the description but guys this app rocks! It allows you to enhance your English skills. If you wanna go further you can purchase the pro version but i can tell you, the free version is top-notch.","2020-08",4,"+free"],[5,"Just love the app ! The way it helps us to improve our vocabulary is commendable. The mini courses are also very much helpful which also makes us learn certain arithmetic tricks, if it starts to provide knowledge about current affairs as well it would just be like the icing on top of a cake for students pursuing competitive exams.","2018-10",4,"+effect,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Very good application for English-learning. It has games, synonyms,antonyms and various interesting facts that are worthy for our knowledge!😀😀😀 But there's one wrong with me; I can't find, where the mathematics' related surprises exist within? I need them very much but I always met sorrow😣😣 The developers are plead to solve the problem and guide me to find it😔😔 It would be a great pleasure for me ! 🙌🙌🙌","2018-12",4,"+fun"],[5,"wow its awesome, i love it, it improves your vocabulary plus your speed towards reading, answering questions and lots more is improved by constantly playing the games and texts. There's alot to gain from this app, i recommend it for one who wants to improve in one's vocabulary or anyone sitting for TOFEL exams.","2019-06",4,"+effect,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Very good application for people to whom English is not native language. People, professionals, students who looks to improve vocabulary can purchase this app. I would never say its excellent app, but it a very good app that ensures to make you aware of words in trend.","2019-12",4,"+wish"],[1,"Doesn't work when signing up. It says it will sent code to email when trying to enter the code in the box for verification doesn't work and wasted my time.","2021-02",3,"bug,data"],[1,"Just deleted this app. Let me tell you. This is very money oriented stupid app, just aiming to get your money. It keeps sending notifications whole day and barely does any useful stuff, till you activate it to pro mode.","2020-08",3,"pay,lock"],[1,"Too hard UI, requires signup, random dump games that I didn't understand what should I do exactly, random popups... Just I deleted.","2021-01",3,"lock,ui"],[1,"This is a very poor app, no words are useful in it. I don't like it at all this is to be downloded and wast of time . Nobody downlode it.","2020-09",3,"lack"],[1,"I paid for life time subscription still cards not open....too bad😞","2022-12",3,"pay"],[2,"woaa... there are only unuseful and uncommon words even in the beginner level... that u called easy level? I cant even imagine how difficult the higher level would be. I dont know to whom this application means to, but definetely not for foreign learners who are looking for vocabulary improvement. (the translation also copied from Oxford Dictionary, which often I cant understand)","2019-03",3,"wish"],[2,"What could be more annoying than irritating, irregular & randomised notifications for such a single word at different times. Please pack all the words which are to be reviewed into only one notification and the timing of that notification should be decided by the user. Please incorporate this feature into your app.","2018-11",3,"lock,ui"],[2,"On foldable phones like the Samsung fold 4. The app restarts when switching from the small screen to the big screen. This app has problems with resizing the Windows in split screen mode as well.","2023-07",3,""],[2,"it is too hard of most of it. It is not personalize at all and too hard to enjoy it. it is being too unkindly for those who english are their second language.","2019-06",3,""],[2,"This was fun before but not until the updates that force you to purchase the app just to increase learning. 🤡","2021-06",3,""],[3,"The voice used for the oral tests is very difficult to understand, with a strange accent that doesn't enunciate vowels correctly. For example, \"clung\" sounded like \"clang.\" It would be helpful if there was an option of another voice or an offering of a sentence to determine the correct word being said.","2023-12",3,"+effect,+listen,+exam"],[3,"I'd put 5 stars, but: 1. please make explanations of new words in MORE SIMPLE language. 1.2 Or as a solution would be even better, if I could translate every single word by tapping on it. I saw it in many other apps, working perfectly. 2. the bag when i get the notification \"can recall the word\" for the word, I've never seen before. 3. the cards are dead now. all the learning words in cards should be linked to original card with explanation/pronouncing etc. thank you,reall looking for updates!","2019-07",3,"lock,+short,+lockp"],[3,"Pros: 1. It 's beginner friendly for anyone who is starting to learn vocabulary in English. 2. You can custom the way you want to learn new words and the number of quizzes per day so that it matches your style of learning. 3. Paid version is worth it , if you use the app EVERYDAY. Cons : 1. Please make the app able to flip horizontally when the user flip the screen device in the horizontal wary. 2. There is still no AI Chatbot to help users learn English better in the app.","2024-02",3,"+custom"],[4,"Very good app to learn new and confusing words with precise meanings. There should also be a list of GRE, TOEFL, and IELTS words and their meanings and a quiz for the same after learning. There also should be pronunciation in the audio provided along so that it becomes a complete vocabulary-enriched app. Please incorporate these features. I am a pro user of this app.","2022-12",3,"+listen,+exam"],[4,"Click on words to get pop-up contextual meaning immediately is a missing feature, making vocabulary improvements less easier than it could be. This is the only shortcoming I have to emphasize. Otherwise you have built an outstanding, inovative app! Worth buying the premium version.","2019-08",3,"+short,+wish"],[5,"I think it's a great app. It is stimulant and it serves as a very good daily brain practice. Being easy to use, I believe, it can be strongly recommended for all ages and language levels, due to difficulty levels intensifying the more you practice, always granting a gradual fresh challenge.","2019-01",3,"+short,+habit"],[5,"the app is really great you can learn new words everyday and it not only tells you a word but also tells you the meaning along with its correct pronunciation...and i specially loved the feature where is tells you a word and you have to write the correct spelling...and also has very cool games to practice your skills so its really worth downloading...and if you are looking for a good english learning app then hey! your search ends here!!","2019-04",3,"+fun,+listen"],[5,"This is one of the best learning apps I have come across. The examples, the graphics, meanings and bite sized lessons are so well designed. I have been using this app for close to a year now, and I have learnt a lot. The minis are amazing too. Learning with knudge.me is fun!","2018-11",3,"+short,+fun,+exam"],[5,"Exceptional app l. I tried vocabulary and it teaches words in kinesthatic way. The words have pictures/images to associate the meaning that helps recall the words. Undoubtedly needs regular practice to register. Also, gives synonyms, Antonyms and usages, quizzes that make it a fun learning.","2024-08",3,"+effect,+fun"],[1,"Junk! Asks the meaning of words and says \"Do you recall this word?\" Before teaching you. Definitely not worth the money. YouTube does better for free. In contacting developer in India via provided email I've never recieved a response. Update: got a response that basically placates rather than solve the problem of asking you the meaning before explaining.","2019-12",2,"pay,cs"],[1,"This app is totally fraud for pro version i have paid for lifetime access and it's been 3 months and its not upgraded and even with continuous mailing there is no response.","2019-11",2,"cs"],[1,"the UI overlaps the phone buttons on screen. how can any one navigate of the star button overlaps the home button of the phone. i don't understand what the developers are thinking before placing it so close.","2025-11",2,"ui"],[1,"Not able to login. Some error occurred whenever I tried. Once the issue resolved just let me know about it so that I check again.","2024-02",2,"bug,data"],[1,"this app is showing repetative contents all the time. Looks like the developers don't update their contents any more. in digest section they only shows 5 paragraphs again and again","2024-07",2,""],[1,"this is so annoying. a lot of pop up and restrictions. go off","2019-06",2,"ui"],[2,"I downloaded this app to make my english strong a bit and after having it I just started reading from its first stage of \"capitalization rules in English\" so now here I wanna inform that I just experienced from rule 1st to rule 2nd about \"Capitalization rules\" which were very informative and for the god sake I learned something really new and my interest was getting updated and boosted as well , but when I was trying for the next (3rd) rule to open suddenly one message flashed out on my mobile","2021-06",2,""],[2,"Amount got deducted from my bank account but still it's not got upgraded to pro. I have sent an email regarding a query. I havent got any response yet, i love this app.","2019-10",2,"data"],[2,"After several weeks of use, I get very few new words every day. And the application tests my knowledge too rarely. You can't get anywhere at this pace","2020-03",2,""],[2,"Good app, but recently I am not receiving the notification for 'New cards' and instead I am getting the notification for 'Do you know the synonym for this word?'. Any way to fix it?","2019-08",2,"lock"],[2,"In the Journey section, under Everyday English, Lesson 7, I can't finish the Practice part even if I selected the correct answers.","2021-12",2,""],[2,"Extra ordinarily disturbing AND frustrating app with pop-up to play word game over other apps. Why to write to exclusively, please open your app and find the problem that I described.","2023-08",2,"lock"],[2,"fun at first but in general, it is very ineffective in improving vocabulary.","2020-04",2,""],[2,"The app consistently logsout after every 5 mins I am frustrated to login each time Please do something about it","2019-09",2,"data"],[3,"I recommend the app! Several fun mini games to improve your English! I still prefer using Duolingo for the more cheerfully look and the incentives for regarly using the app to not lose previous progress. Plus Duolingo is free. For paying about 13 Euroes for the app I expected a more fresh interface with smoother animations, more options for an example colours and accents. But the mini games are great and it's the app's winning point. Make the app more modern and it would get 5 stars from me :-D","2019-01",2,"pay,ui,wish,+fun,+listen,+exam,+free,+wish"],[3,"In the \"English for the Workplace\" journey in the section labeled \"Tips\" I am unable to advance while giving one of two correct answers. The answer in question: If an employee applies for the post of Superintendant, they should submit their certificates to the manager. I haven't tried the he/she variant out of a mix of stubbornness and principal. I've used the app for a half hour now and have had an otherwise positive experience.","2019-08",2,""],[3,"Thanks for the app and I love this app and I also recommended to my closed ones but Please add digests everyday. I like Digests and are really cool thing. The substitutes part of the digest is really helpful. But you provide very less.you add only one digest for every two days please add at least 2-3digests a day to improve better.","2018-11",2,"wish,+effect,+wish"],[3,"It's good if you're starting out with English but for those who are looking to learning better English and the nuances between words, it's sometimes misleading. Eg: Extant is defined as \"In existence\" and an example is given, whereas it actually means \"surviving\" (as in something which is existence where others have perished), like an extant copy of a banned book.","2020-05",2,"+exam"],[4,"Learning using this app would be more comfortable and convenient if it had a more readable, larger, and more contrasting font. I have a lot of trouble reading text on the app. Also, I dont understand the limitation to only having one active course? At least all course subscription should be on the home so we can read them manually without the guided learning thing if that what makes it difficult. Otherwise I like the learning technique the app implements. Thank you","2023-06",2,"+short"],[4,"Your app is suggesting wrong synonyms, people are not from literary background that they have the license to invent an understanding, specific to readers. I request you to please improve, this is a very important part of English Grammar and a good vocabulary, to understand synonyms. Otherwise I would have given 5 stras, overall your app is still one of best to improve English.","2021-06",2,"+wish"],[4,"This app is really amazing, it helps me a lot in my English language and it helps me to memorize more vocabs, I really like it and I invite other people to utilize it. Quizlet is my second option recommended for people after Knudge.","2020-08",2,"+effect"],[4,"It is really very useful to improve your vocabulary. The flashcards are the attractive part. The daily training and games keeps me entertained and helps me be consistent. There are digests that helps you remember things in a pictorial way. The journey helps us and guides us through the path. Loved this app.","2022-10",2,"+effect,+review,+fun,+habit,+wish"],[4,"I purchased the pro to avail the offline minis on the go without connection, but sadly it doesn't worked on offline mode even though I've downloaded it. I wonder what could be the problem. I hope that the games could be played offline mode too, I really enjoy.","2019-07",2,"+fun,+wish"],[4,"Some glitches, takes ages to load and I took 2 weeks to find the settings to change the notification frequency, but apart from that, a great free app for advanced learners.","2019-04",2,"+free,+lockp"],[4,"Good app. One issue, Cards should fit to screen. I have to scroll up to read whole card. While there is half of my screen is blank. I can send you a email, if you give me your email.","2020-01",2,""],[4,"This app has everything to do and the games in it are the amazing, the reason why I have rate 4 stars is I think that there should be more games that should be not pro. I hope you will do the improvement and other that amazing app.","2020-10",2,"+fun,+wish"],[5,"Marvelous app. I would like to recommend it for those newbies who are learning English language. It has a lot of mini games that help us to improve listening, reading, grammar and writing skills. The pro-version is more useful than the free one because includes a lot more of content.","2023-01",2,"+fun,+listen,+free,+wish"],[5,"This app has helped me to improve my vocabulary, it comes with a variety of games to keep the learning process entertaining, it also features a lot of mini courses to help you improve your english even more. Although the free version is limited, I'd recommend paying the small fee to experience this app to its fullest. Highly recommended for beginners and experienced learners alike.","2018-12",2,"+effect,+fun,+free,+wish"],[5,"Update: The issue has been fixed by knudge me. Thank you for listening to customer :) You guys need to download this app. I'm surprised by myself that I understand some vocabulary and my brain immediately recognize that I learned that vocab first from knudge me! If I had to give feedback, maybe add some fun to grammar learning more! The vocab learning is already amazing, if you improve the grammar one, this app must be better:)","2023-02",2,"+effect,+fun,+listen,+custom,+wish"],[5,"I love the notifications for the tests to help me remember the words I've learned to further broaden my vocabulary. I've tried other vocab apps and they don't compare, purely because you have to actually go into the app and just read instead of the nice and creative quizzes they give in the notification bar with this app. Very nice app, I highly recommend this app to anyone looking to deepen their diction.","2019-01",2,"+effect,+exam,+lockp"],[5,"I first examined this to assist in ESOL tutoring but I've also found I've learned many new words as well, and have since purchased a premium subscription. You CAN teach an old dog new tricks! 😅 It's quite intuitive and the notifications are helpful in giving a microlesson. It's also packed with features. Feed your head!","2018-09",2,"+effect,+exam,+lockp"],[5,"A very useful App to improve your English speaking and vocabulary skills. Easy to learn with fun games and puzzles, quizzes, facts, timely revision of complex words with it's usage and synonym, etc...overall a great tool to upgrade yourself...Thank you Knudge.me!!","2018-10",2,"+short,+fun,+wish"],[5,"The 2 screens \"game over submitting game\" and \"generating game\" are too bright white and contrasting with the dark blue background... I'm playing in the dark most of the time, it hurts the eyes. Other than that I love the game.","2019-02",2,"+fun"],[1,"This application requires an account to use. Additionally, the example in the preview regarding climatic and climactic has a typo. The spelling is climactic, not climcatic. I suggest using spell check, because this app will obviously teach you improper spelling.","2018-11",1,"data,wrong"],[1,"This is the most useless app I found here in the Play Store learn in English when I started a course in this application just did not to learn some new words and if I am committing a mistake it is not even going in another face or question just stuck","2022-06",1,"bug,wrong"],[1,"Why can't you save the words you didn't know in the games somewhere to review them later? And to actually study them? And build vocabulary? You had one job and you failed miserably, I wouldn't honestly recommend this game to anyone","2021-11",1,""],[1,"Installed app, received OTP code via email, but the field is grayed out and does not allow me to enter the OTP code!","2019-07",1,""],[1,"They don't let you use the app till you dont sign up. And sign up never receives the otp for decades on email.","2019-04",1,""],[1,"They took out 20.19 with out my consent. Tried emailing them for a full refund and still no response. They are theives.","2020-11",1,"pay,cs"],[1,"poorly designed app, there's no selection of levels, where one can start and move ahead step by step.","2018-12",1,"ui"],[1,"Good initially then repetition of excerise over and over again, especially Voyage Sea","2020-04",1,""],[1,"Didn't help as per my expectation, felt like stuck at the same level as it became a child's play","2019-09",1,"bug"],[1,"remove the feature of lock cards I am facing problem that you just provide few cards for longer period which ultimately dereases my speed of learning new words","2021-02",1,""],[1,"notifications close when opening from lockscreen, not been fixed in months","2019-02",1,"lock"],[1,"Even after buying the pro version, new words are locked..","2021-06",1,""],[1,"Way too fiddly and frustrating setup. Uninstalled","2020-10",1,""],[1,"It was working properly on 1st day...but after that it not opening..","2021-03",1,""],[1,"U shud need not to enter facebook password .it is simply hacking.it is personal.","2018-12",1,""],[2,"I had it for a very long time but never enjoyed it. it feels random and annoying. I am cancelling my subscription and deleting it. will be looking for more reasonable and engaging alternatives. my goal is to augment my vocabulary, but this app doesn't work for me.","2025-01",1,"pay,bug,ui"],[2,"Takes too much time and there is no way to unlock new words and to earn credits. I also shared it to my freind through whatsapp so that they'll give me credits as promised but the credit was not given.","2019-03",1,""],[2,"Writing is miniature! Ad Heavy. Confusing homepage. Required to sign in to play. Uninstalled.","2021-03",1,"ad,data,ui"],[2,"Nice concept but very weird selection of uncommonly used words to learn. What a pity!","2018-10",1,""],[3,"I like the app but I hate the coin system. I decided to go with the premium subscription but from the app I learned that there is a limit to consume coins even for a paid memeber. Either make it completely free or remove the limit from pro membership. But, I still like the concept of learning email writing and correct capitalization.","2021-06",1,"pay,+effect,+free"],[3,"It's okay, what's missing for me are translations to the words of you're not a native speaker. Also since the flashcards are getting portrayed as overlay, you can't just leave the cars to look up the word and come back, which sucks...","2022-11",1,"+review"],[3,"I try to give it a try again, since it was rude that I didn't give a proper explanation. Overall the design interface is excellent and the minis is helpful. But it will be better if you could give some kind of tutorial. Since this app is different from other app in similiar focus. Like how the card work, and how the game mode work, because the game mode used for revise than to learn because of time constraint.","2018-12",1,"data,ui,+effect,+fun"],[3,"That big vertical moving timing balloon in one of the categories is really nauseating! Got me dizzy! Really distracting! Your eyes get fixated on the balloon more than the quiz. Like a vertical hypnotizing pendulum. Maybe it's only me.","2020-09",1,""],[4,"The experience and learning are both amazing. However I feel if a feature was there where we immediately practice what we've learnt then the app would have been complete. It's difficult to remember the new learnt words otherwise.","2019-12",1,"+effect"],[4,"It's a wonderful app for learning english and improving your vocabulary. It would be nice if they allow more than one course at a time. Make it free and u may earn from ads","2020-01",1,"+effect,+free,+wish"],[4,"Really great app. Heaps of cool games and seems to be structured well for easy learning. The only bad thing is, it prompts to upgrade very often. I will most likely upgrade to pro regardless.","2020-07",1,"+short,+fun"],[4,"The new dark mode is good but I want to disable it. There should be an option to change it. I couldn't find the one. Most of the apps give option to select light, dark or system mode. I think this app has only one option, that is system mode. So if the Android is in dark mode, the app takes the dark mode and that cannot be changed. The daily cards are better be viewed in light mode. The developers should consider this.","2021-09",1,"+habit"],[4,"Excellent app! Best in the category of vocabulary building. One thing that I loved the most is the notification; it asks you question on regular basis, which you can answer without even opening the app.","2018-12",1,"+lockp"],[4,"Simple and singnificant if you are keen inersted to learn English Vocabulary .However, you cant be proficient in english until you dont do practice that's what demerit of this app just memorising words.","2019-02",1,"+short"],[5,"So far the best app I 've used to Keep learning and practicing English, I dont have any complain I just would like you to suggest that all the vocabulary cards included the pronunciation section, some words I knew already the meaning but I noticed I didn't have the right pronunciation, great Job guys Keep up the excellent job","2019-07",1,"+listen"],[5,"I've been a regular user of the app for quite some time. Overall learning games are good. Expecting to have pronunciation sound 🔊. Other synonyms of word. Couldn't able to bookmark or store the word in some games. Hoping to have better experience in learning.","2023-12",1,"+fun,+listen"],[5,"One of the best apps, and with unique way of learning. It prompts with word/passage and their meanings, images, pronunciation and lots of details. There are many quiz and fun way to learn. Friendly app for any age group by friendly developers. Resolved my issue within hours.","2019-06",1,"+fun,+listen"],[5,"This is one of the best applications I have come across...it really helps a lot in vocabulary...tenses..preposition acticles and all kinds of grammar...it makes my day simpler....it even keeps a tests so...that u won't forgot the words their meaning with an example and synonyms as well as Antonyms...would prefer to take a look into it..","2022-09",1,"+effect,+short,+exam"],[5,"every attractive app ! As it has many games which we can play when we are bored, which will provide you knowledgeable information. Best app I have ever got for grammar and vocabulary words, never thought of this kind of app will exist in this playstore. Daily we get cards to use it in our daily life and also it recalls us the learned words. THANKS KNUDGE. ME SO MUCH !!!","2019-01",1,"+effect,+fun,+habit"],[5,"Wonderful app . Has the best content which is delivered to you in the right way, it ensures you learn and remember it . I use this as a free mode ,So the options are quite limited for me. It has games, challenges and other things making the process of learning a intresting.","2022-08",1,"+effect,+fun,+free"],[5,"Loving this game. starts easy and as you progress and learn the game also learns how well you are doing and adjusts the game style. It also does a daily 'what does this word mean' which helps increase your use of vocabulary. Great game and worth the download","2019-05",1,"+effect,+short,+fun,+habit"],[5,"It has everything an English beginner needs, and more! Even if you are intermediate or advanced, there is still something to learn. I love how they visualize the words so yiu can easily remember the meanings. Great work","2019-07",1,"+effect"],[5,"The UI of Knudge is colorful and charming which does a stupendous job at making me crave to revisit the game from time to time. The enjoyable games lead to a fun learning experience that I haven't been able to find in other apps like elevate.","2020-08",1,"+fun"],[5,"The app is really good. With interactive notifications and daily games, it makes learning effortless. Just a point though, when I go to minis tab and select any course there and then press back button the app crashes.","2018-10",1,"+fun,+habit,+lockp"],[1,"I literally dislike this app because it asks for money to enter into next levels.. I enjoy it a little bit.. They only gave prepositions work in grammar and 3 mini games and then repeatedly asks for money to make it helpful..","2024-03",0,"pay,repeat"],[1,"I downloaded this app but i am not able to verify my account as the OTP is send but there is no option to verify and when I click on the box were OTP needs to be given then their is no option of keyboard to type... Worst app","2022-07",0,"data"],[1,"If you miss daily cards for too many days, it doesn't allow you to reset the course. Which is most annoying. Pro is useless. There are better alternatives for this app.","2022-10",0,"data,ui"],[1,"It's not helping at all. I choose a target of 10 words a day. But the app is not giving any notification regarding them and no notification for practise is appearing in the phone","2019-03",0,"lock"],[1,"I bought this app with a Pro Lifetime subscription on Nov 30, 2018. Now I've logged in and tried to restore the purchase but it said:\"no valid purchase found\". No way to solve the issue???","2025-03",0,"pay"],[1,"really good app if u are a newbie to English, but if u are looking for advance level English like for competitive exams then this is not for u. most of the (70-90%) words and phrases are from secondary school level","2019-03",0,""],[1,"can only learn one course a time. (not vocabulary and idiom at the same time) .....time to unlock just one card is too long. waste time . Not good for remembering word, just for test","2019-03",0,""],[1,"Not as I expected, this app didn't help you to understand the meaning of words , class of word etc . it is just MCQ's test for Vocabulary.","2020-04",0,""],[1,"Please restore my purchase for elevate pro. I deleted my account so I can reset my progress and now its saying I don't have the pro version anymore.","2022-05",0,"data"],[1,"I'm still not receiving notifications from this app. Although i have allowed it's access to draw over other apps and related notification settings.","2021-07",0,"lock"],[1,"It doesn't work. I tried but it shows me version invalidation all the time even though I had downloaded it from Google Play","2026-06",0,"bug"],[1,"no notifications received even after all permissions provided","2026-06",0,"lock"],[1,"This app is very bad. The word maze game never works even I bought a new device with enough ram it's still not working.","2018-10",0,"bug"],[1,"Around 150 English words that are must for learners to know. How can you make an app about the English language and screw up the first sentence we read??","2023-05",0,""],[1,"You'll hardly ever use a word this app suggests. Notifications are very distracting!","2018-09",0,"lock"],[1,"Nope. Requires email for nefarious purposes. Apps that do this aren't very good. I'm not impressed.","2019-03",0,""],[1,"Marked me wrong for sentences that was correct (written exactly like the answers provided).","2021-10",0,""],[1,"Requires immediate registration, you can't opt out. Instant delete.","2021-08",0,""],[1,"Difficult to navigate. Lack of clear instructions","2021-12",0,""],[1,"Cannot download this aaplication as the progress bar stucks at 81% Please help!","2020-05",0,"bug"],[1,"I downloaded it once and I was not opening..The app keeps stopping","2021-10",0,""],[1,"I already now English snd finished school, this is all messed up. Apparently compliment means to complete something.","2020-02",0,""],[1,"Why do I need to unlock other chapters with 20 credits? Should I use it for learning something or is it a premium game?","2025-07",0,"pay"],[1,"Worrest app, iam received mail otp but app not allowing to enter otp","2024-06",0,""],[1,"Good but translation of Tamil language is not available.","2020-04",0,""],[1,"Immediate uninstall. Why would any non-banking app want your email? Totally unacceptable.","2022-03",0,""],[1,"I bought pro version but still I have to wait for my cards to open. I have to wait one hour for each card to open? What crappy user experience is this?","2019-09",0,""],[1,"Very slow app...app content loading time is very high...plz improve this","2021-03",0,"bug,wish"],[1,"Unfortunately, an invalid version shows and and closed the app😢😢","2025-05",0,""],[1,"I am sure that it is a great app for learning vocabullary with much entertainment","2020-07",0,""],[1,"Terrible UI. No option for just 1 word of the day","2021-01",0,"ui"],[1,"Didn't get any good at English, because they for money .","2020-02",0,"pay"],[1,"Very irritating due to not option for notifications off","2019-12",0,"lock"],[1,"still i dont think you require email id of any person ,any app should not asked for email id the progress can b saved in app only","2020-05",0,""],[1,"I bought the pro version and the app is asking to subscribe for pro features.","2019-09",0,"pay"],[1,"i had purchased this app but since i had changed my phone i am unable to download this app, it always stucks at 9.81 mb please do something","2019-07",0,"bug"],[1,"Take too much time to load contents","2019-09",0,""],[2,"Daily words notification not coming at all. After a few week notification of the daily words stop coming. I also checked the application setting and it is all fine there. Hope that it will be fixed in the next update.","2018-10",0,"lock"],[2,"Requires subscription cause ad revenue isn't enough for anything nowadays. Only gives two exercises a day, with echo being given to me 4 days in a row and on top of that the person speaking doesn't pronoinciate well enough, so words like pebble can easily sound like bubble.","2022-08",0,"pay,ad"],[2,"I don't think it is focusing on convesational vocabulary, probably it is helpful for those who wants apply for test, but neither the vocabulary builder easy mode nor the intermediate course has been helpful so far!","2019-02",0,""],[2,"Games leap in difficulty, words with appropriate meanings marked wrong, and the mini lessons have huge gaps in grammar. The maths lessons ability levels and areas are allbovee the place.","2019-02",0,""],[2,"Hi, I already bought the Knudge IELTS MASTER app with my FACEBOOK account. I bought it and downloaded it to my mobile. Now, I am trying to SIGN IN with my PC the first time, but I always see that warning is \"Facebook has detected that knudge.me does not use a secure connection to transmit information. You won't be able to use Facebook to log into this app until Knudge.me updates your security settings.\"... So how could you help me with it?","2021-06",0,"bug,data"],[2,"This is app is no longer as user-friendly as before. I am no longer receiving notifications eventhough I have checked the settings on my phone and made sure the permission is allowed.","2019-08",0,"lock"],[2,"For what level is this? For full proficiency?! I start easy level and I don't understand any word even it is hard for me to understand meaning. I will continue to use for next days to see do I missing something... Then maybe I will change score","2019-10",0,""],[2,"it pops up a message saying this version of the app is not genuine although I have downloaded it from the Google Play store.","2026-08",0,""],[2,"Why the sudden price increase. I was planning on buying this, and then the next day prices just doubled from 799 to 1499 for lifetime.. Like what the heck","2018-11",0,"pay"],[2,"App is not being refreshed with new content. The exercises are great but they have repetitive content.","2025-03",0,"repeat"],[2,"They'll let u play first initial levels of games. And as soon u start enjoying they'll ask for membership. This app is less about knowledge more about minting. 👎","2020-04",0,""],[2,"The application look great and all but I have subscribed for the pro version. It still didn't get activated in my application.. what do I do?","2021-06",0,"pay"],[2,"First of all before installing this app ,I read reviews. I become satisfied. Then I download this app. But after using this I came know that some mistakes were here in this app. Like, even though we gave correct answer I would marked as wrong and showing the points the same.its to bad","2020-03",0,"wrong"],[2,"Too complicated and too many features. I just want to learn some words and somehow I have no idea how to use the app.","2019-04",0,""],[2,"App does open. Keep telling me that something went wrong, check internet connection or try again.","2019-10",0,""],[2,"I like this application 🙂 its great though but why I am giving 2stars because I couldn't log into my account and it's to laggy pls fix the bug","2021-07",0,"bug,data"],[2,"A great app with great features, only after you paid for them. Sad but true.","2019-08",0,""],[3,"there's no clear setting and the layout is confusing. If you're into flash card method, this probably work for you. If you want to practice your grammar though, better prepare some cash. Not much, if you really *really* need to learn proper English for a test or something.","2019-01",0,"ui,+exam"],[3,"The app was good I had been receiving 20 notifications daily but suddenly I stopped receiving notifications I'm a pro member and I'm not happy with it please fix this. I have checked my settings to receive notifications without any problems but still I'm not receiving any.","2022-06",0,"lock,wish,+habit,+lockp"],[4,"I love the app, and I have refreshed my vocabulary with just the free version. I wish there was a way to review and study the words in the games, like Echo and Fly High, especially if you missed that word.","2019-01",0,"+review,+fun,+free,+wish"],[4,"This is a wonderful application, definitely made by some geniuses... An improvement in it can be more helpful to the learners and that is, as there on the top of the page on the word card the thorough meaning is already mentioned below the word on top, so it could be the best one if there may be some explanatory detailed meaning in the meaning section which may help them who could not understand it properly only with the help of thorough meaning on top. Rest all is the best.","2025-12",0,"+effect,+wish"],[4,"You can find everything you need to imrove your english language and espacially your vocab in an easy and very fun way. It's the vocabulary builder section for me among all the other features that most helped me improve.","2023-02",0,"+effect,+short,+fun,+wish"],[4,"I am not able to purchase this app using my credit card. When I attempted it say correct the card details I mean the number but I had double checked thereafter it repeats the same message. Please check and help me to go ahead with the purchase.","2019-01",0,""],[4,"A really good and helpful app! The only thing that I wish is that they would add audios with the bite-sized card, so that we could hear the proper way to pronunciat the phrases. I love this app, totally recommend!","2019-06",0,"+effect,+short,+listen,+wish"],[4,"i agree this app is lovely and it teaches words efficiently. But in limited version the amount of words listed is too low and also pro version seems to be costly for a common man.","2019-04",0,""],[4,"this app is Soo good and have less adds and you can do English courses completely free but the we have to give money to unlock more questions or quizes but overall its very good I will give this app a 9.5/10.","2026-06",0,"+free"],[4,"A great app for improving English...an innovative approach... But why the notification cards are so small 😏 Developers may extend the unread card sizes vertically, so that there won't be much need of scrolling... I'm sure most of the undead cards aren't that long that they require to be scrolled...also now a days there's new aspect ratio 18:9 AKA 2:1 in most phones, so why tiny unread cards !!!","2018-12",0,"+effect,+lockp"],[4,"This app gives the easiest way of remembering unacquainted words. The synonyms marked are quite according to interests. This will make sure you learn at least 5 words a day.","2018-09",0,"+effect"],[5,"BEST APP ever. \"How it works\" is appreciable. I could remember and learn better now. Words(with meaning, image and usage) in notification itself , don't let us forget to learn daily. It also tests whether we remember or not. If there could be a \"gk\" part of such app it would be amazing.","2020-02",0,"+effect,+review,+exam,+habit,+lockp"],[5,"It's really fun to play because every day we have to complete it's exercise and a new word that I never heard of it before. This can improve my english more fluently and have the word-a-day section to learn it more deeply. It just that the ad is disturbing and I like to try the pro but I need to pay for it.","2018-12",0,"+fun,+habit,+wish"],[5,"one of the \"Amazing\" Apps on vocabulary and english grammar, its gives you daily dose of 3-4 words even when you forget to open the app on any day, but they remember and they gives you words you last searched for so that you can remember that word. just loved its way of teaching!!!!","2019-03",0,"+effect,+review,+habit"],[5,"i love this app its really good for students who are studying for their ielts exams and also for those who are studying English in various forms if you want to learn new and different worda with their synonyms its the app that you are finding it has more options to study you can improve your writing with the article of this post you just need to enroll to them all in all its a must have app","2019-06",0,"+exam,+wish"],[5,"Best app out there, learn new words daily, I love the notification flash card feature, I wish I could get around 10 cards wihout Elevate pro, but that's all right, soon I may buy the pro pack, but I am enjoying and learning through basic version for last 2-3 years, Must try !","2021-08",0,"+fun,+habit,+lockp,+wish"],[5,"Its a great app! I open it everyday since early Febuary! One feature that I would say would make the app even better is adding mnemonics for us to better remember the meanings. Also please add widgets!! But there is a login issue with Facebook. Could the developers fix this?","2023-09",0,"+effect,+lockp,+wish"],[5,"No amount of praise is enough for this app. It really makes you think hard and stick to your vocab regime. I think that buying the complete app is a good investment, but it works fine without that too. Completely recommended for people preparing for all sorts of exams.","2019-04",0,"+exam"],[5,"Must provide some more courses for free but still very good app. I have been using it for 2 months and it looks good to me. I haven't spent any money on it. But if you want you can spend money to take some courses and believe me it will worth your time and money.","2023-03",0,"+free"],[5,"Unlike other apps, Knudge helps you learn practical words that you can use in everyday life. It does certainly more than just that, which you should explore yourselves. Just go for it guys, you won't be disappointed! -Happy and satisfied user.","2022-08",0,"+effect"],[5,"I been playing this for weeks before my classes started. I was so amaze because in college we have that one subject of language proficiency and I still remember those learning a grammar on this app, it helps me on my recitation. I hope more free features here.","2022-09",0,"+effect,+exam,+free,+wish"],[5,"Guys, this is a wonderful application. Even in free version of app, we can learn a lot. We should appreciate the work of the developers by purchasing the pro version even if i couldn't but someone who can, please do purchase. This app if used regularly will surely help you a lot.","2019-05",0,"+free"],[5,"This app is great but I want to delete my account for time being! Please help me! There's no option for deleting Knudge.me account. And one more thing, I even tried to contact you via email but the \"Contact Us\" button is not responding. Please fix this bug issue and help me out to delete my Knudge.me account. Waiting for your reply.","2018-12",0,""],[5,"I enjoy the learning process and repetition. I think certain games like the matching game should offer a second try with the same words until the words are familiarize for better learning. But over all the game is amazing.","2022-11",0,"+review,+fun"],[5,"Best app for improving your English. I have searched a lot for many vocabulary apps but none was at par with this one. I salute to the knudge.me team for their outstanding work! Thank you knudge.me:) Only one request, if this app can go absolutely offline, please.","2019-07",0,"+effect"],[5,"Fun app that has a variety of words to train on. Neat distraction for a few times in the day that you get to learn from. UI is also smooth. full lifetime version is also affordable and I'll be buying it soon.","2022-09",0,"+fun"]];